{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play as a dog your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become mankind\u2019s best friend or worst nightmare! Befriend the people around you to get good stuff or just steal anything not locked down. Pick a path with dog skills to hone your dog and perfect the way you want to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/53ba03bc3be147b6f35684397c207571.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive in a vast modern world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, loot, and dig your way through life. Explore a world where the people and items are always changing. The city and its surroundings are yours to make your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/e784602254a6a2d0dd3e4b2ddb3fac4b.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade for the Best Equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a quick snack? How about a weapon or some armor? This cat has it all but drives a hard bargain. Never fear! There is always room to negotiate. Sell special items, haggle, and do favors to get those prices right where you need them to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck out your penthouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dirt Digger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/3f2283025b06f807ab0c6e1df169920fd1b9e234.jpg"},{"name":"The Heart of Nature","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/07991c3f28f0a7ca2b68b9ca824dc102f9539116.jpg"},{"name":"Unstoppable Force","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/f34a7029b4a8aed807872f86182244e4f9a1dab9.jpg"},{"name":"The Greatest Treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/4001c9ce9558bc5e4fa342fbb4c81c78c0d3dfef.jpg"},{"name":"Dangerous Experience","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/64c69252ecab84cebbb695ebec790ba5af0295f5.jpg"},{"name":"Assert Your Dominance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/dd8a1ae4c655bae1e2ef8a9415ef1dd2d82be7c6.jpg"},{"name":"Urban Terror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2027590/6c22cb9a6f8629efcb3a5943a473d0cda4ab42e4.jpg"},{"name":"Instructions Unclear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/p