.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/99e284f8d82538067df2454bbddcf716.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deck out your penthouse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dog should be without a home. And for you that means getting a badass apartment with the best stuff the city has to offer. Acquire amazing food, water, crafting options, and plenty more by expanding your apartment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/a0c4280423a7f2aff0e7e39079769b11.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Mystery of Doggo City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are all the other pets missing, what happened to your human, and why do bad things keep happening to you? Work with a colorful cast of allies to uncover the mysteries of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.poster.avif?t=1759852345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.webm?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2027590/extras/07979fc2c52881d2c2687de29141ebb3.mp4?t=1759852345\" type=\"video/mp4\"><